2026-10-09T01:07:01.8379929Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8380106Z E           - heading "住宿與宿舍" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8380248Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8381167Z E           - paragraph: Our international office has prepared an accommodation guide for each campus, containing a comprehensive list of resources and contacts to help you find the accommodation that best suits your needs.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8381392Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8381687Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8382800Z E           - paragraph: "SKEMA Compass Webinar Series: connect with the International Office team as well as current students virtually to go over key topics such as visa, housing, health insurance, banking, transportation, student life & associations, and so much more!"
