2026-10-09T01:07:01.8383093Z E           - group: 再看 3 則資料
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8383229Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8383449Z E           - paragraph: 先確認交換生住宿資格，再把交通與餐食納入預算。
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8383587Z E           - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8383718Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8383818Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8384006Z E           - heading "每月生活預算" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8384142Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8385086Z E           - paragraph: Some hotels offer our students special rates and are close to bus stops and the campus, such as Mercure Lourdes, Ramada Lourdes, Mercure Savassi, Novotel Savassi, Ibis Budget Savassi and Royal Golden Savassi.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8385236Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8385370Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8386420Z E           - paragraph: While most students prefer biking or walking around campus, the GoRaleigh bus system and NC State’s Wolfline provide free or low-cost transportation to popular areas around the city.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8386561Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8386704Z E           - group: 再看 1 則資料
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8386844Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8386947Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8387127Z E           - heading "飲食與採買" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8387268Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8388908Z E           - paragraph: A shopping centre has opened next to the residential building, which includes a supermarket, restaurant and fitness centre SKEMA's accommodation guide will help you find accommodation, with practical advice on guarantor solutions and other accommodation partners.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8389108Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8389260Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8389902Z E           - paragraph: The Belo Horizonte campus is located in the Savassi district, close to the city's main shopping centers, excellent restaurants and museums.
